iagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass"},"testCase":{"id":"cabc78dd0e88f811788f3d26fc706267","externalId":"41b0c715ede4ee806e611765b2f43a41","name":"[dev] S20 Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts","fullName":"TC-03 Search & Sort › TC-03/S20"},"descriptionHtml":"<p><b>Case priority: P1 · our extension of a stated behaviour</b> · ours: fast re-type and whitespace-only query.</p><div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>Approach</b> · TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>S20</b> Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts</p><p><b>UAT steps / ticket ACs covered:</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Hospital: search by name, by room, by MRN and by diagnosis each returns the correct matching patients, each field on its own. (UAT TC-03; TFA-92581 AC 2; TFA-92581 AC 5)</li><li><b>U4</b> Nursing Home: search by name, by unit/room, by MRN and by facility each returns the correct matching residents, each field on its own. (UAT TC-03; TFA-92581 AC 3; TFA-92581 AC 6)</li></ul><p><b>Test design technique: </b>Error guessing (error-guessing) — Go straight for the places most likely to break (failures, double clicks, two tabs, a wrong clock, injected instructions).</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture</p><p><b>When </b>Hospital: type 'pneumonia' and, without waiting, replace it with 'zz-no-match-zz'; clear it; type three spaces. Nursing Home Today's Visits: type 'QA Resident' and, without waiting, replace it with 'zz-no-match-zz'; clear it; type three spaces</p><p><b>Then </b>After the second query the record is not listed and the no-match message shows (no stale results from the first query). After Clear it is back. Spaces alone show the full list, not a no-match message. Same in both contexts</p><p><b>Pass rule (oracle, excerpt): </b>oracle.mjs: cp1 mustContain 'No patients match', mustNotContain {hospitalPatient}; cp2 mustContain {hospitalPatient}; cp3 mustContain {hospitalPatient}, mustNotContain 'No patients match'; cp4 mustContain 'No residents match', mustNotContain {snfResident}; cp5 mustContain {snfResident}; cp6 mustContain {snfResident}, mustNotContain 'No residents match' (U1, U4)</p><p><b>Where it ran: </b>dev unit U23; test method AGENT · Browser agent; lane planned in the matrix: browser agent (automated)</p><p><small>S20 is our own case number (its number in the coverage matrix cases/TC-03.matrix.json), not a step number of the UAT document.</small></p></div><p><b>Environment: dev</b> — dev deployment, build <code>8b4be94</code> (Deploy Convex, 2026-10-19T17:04:37Z); account and address are not written into the report; run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>.</p><p><b>Test method:</b> AGENT · Browser agent — as classified in cases/test-methods.json, which says it runs on both; Source: <code>dev</code>.</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-03/S20</p><p><b>Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92581 Search &amp; Sort (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U23.verdict.json</code>), unit U23 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 263 s, $0.60.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U23 (#23, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Search box, both contexts. Same legacy seed, same search box, read-only typing (diagnosis words, names / MRN across contexts, fast re-type and whitespace). No part opens a chart or changes a row. Runs together with TC-03/S07, TC-03/S17.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #23, U23; checked: yes): <b>Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1)</b> — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-03 Search & Sort","S20 Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"b9b57f5b24a2685cca50322901297266","originalFileName":"003b9af1-fc7b-41d2-bb4f-e380be2b9938-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":1982,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"1a12aa97d41d47e5ed9654662c8dcd3b","originalFileName":"0d5f009c-934b-4280-a0bf-f4bee05adcaa-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":66707,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"0ad029a05386d71ba102606c0f289699","originalFileName":"1c282920-2392-443e-adf0-f41a45935d20-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2497,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"5607f14c53049d9ce03b602984d300bb","originalFileName":"160c9d38-6d03-412f-842b-082a5f7e46a2-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":77881,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"e3098504dee4d5e46a07cb1dad71d3bc","originalFileName":"25a9f887-4b84-470b-93f8-445130b1ed65-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2584,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"4bd0829801a3563d8abef630ee9275dc","originalFileName":"45ffb488-46e9-4420-9dfb-3c94fd9b08c9-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":74431,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"8dbd8ec197e24c1434d585cade487173","originalFileName":"038aee4f-cd1d-410c-9273-fe8fc1946128-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":1828,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id"